---
.title = "Synchronize a File with Io MemoryMap",
.date = "2024-01-01",
.author = "ZigCC",
.layout = "section.shtml",
---

`std.Io.File.MemoryMap` maps file storage, then exposes explicit `read`, `write`,
`setLength`, and `destroy` synchronization points. The example changes a mapped
byte and flushes it back to the file.

